[agent:result]   It contains rows of data. To create a table, users must have CREATE_TABLE and
[agent:result]   USE_SCHEMA permissions on the schema, and they must have the USE_CATALOG
[agent:result]   permission on its parent catalog. To query a table, users must have the SELECT
[agent:result]   permission on the table, and they must have the USE_CATALOG permission on its
[agent:result]   parent catalog and the USE_SCHEMA permission on its parent schema.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   A table can be managed or external. From an API perspective, a __VIEW__ is a
[agent:result]   particular kind of table (rather than a managed or external table).
